DirkuLator 0.5: diagnostic only (no rendering change). EDEN_TASK_PROBE names the probed draw's stage program addresses
(match eden_log "Lowered native shader at" for keys) and describes bad primitive indices (groups, largest index, ranges,
first bad triple) plus raw index/position words of the first decoded group. For the 12-task canopy draws of 0.4.

